    "p2b16"
   ],
   "role": "body",
   "why": "outside any article",
   "words": 40,
   "text": "This commentary thus explains the meaning of the Quran in such a way as to give readers a clearer understanding of the message of the Quran and helps them in finding their own way of making it relevant to themselves."
